  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 14 + 7 ÷ 729 × 81 - 9 = 500.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 81 and 9, ÷ and ×**\n\nGiven: 14 + 7 ÷ 729 × 81 - 9 = 500.\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 14 + 7 × __**729 ÷ 9**__ - 81 = 500\n\n⇒ 14 + __**7 × 81**__ - 81 = 500\n\n⇒ __**14 + 567**__ - 81 = 500\n\n⇒ __581 - 81__ = 500\n\n⇒ 500 = 500\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) 14 and 9, - and ×\n\nGiven: 14 + 7 ÷ 729 × 81 - 9 = 500\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 9 + __**7 ÷ 729**__ - 81 × 14 = 500\n\n⇒ 9 + 0.097 - __**81 × 14**__ = 500\n\n⇒ __**9**____** + 0.097**__ - 1134 = 500\n\n⇒ 9.097 - 1134 = 500\n\n⇒ -1124.903 ≠ 500\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 7 and 729, + and -\n\nGiven: 14 + 7 ÷ 729 × 81 - 9 = 500\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 14 - __**729 ÷ 7**__ × 81 + 9 = 500\n\n⇒ 14 - __**104.15**____** × 81**__ + 9 = 500\n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 8436.15 __**+**____** 9**__ = 500\n\n⇒ __**23 - 8436.15**__ = 500\n\n⇒ -8413.15 ≠ 500\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 81 and 7, + and ×\n\nGiven: 14 + 7 ÷ 729 × 81 - 9 = 500\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 14 × __**81 ÷ 729**__ + 7 - 9 = 500\n\n⇒ 14 × 0.11 + 7 - 9 = 500\n\n⇒ __**1.54 + 7**__ - 9 = 500\n\n⇒ __**8.54**____** - 9**__ = 500\n\n⇒ -0.46 ≠ 500\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
